{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2f <strong>Serve Turkey\u2019s Spiciest Wraps in Your Own Shop!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master of \u00c7i\u011fk\u00f6fte</strong> puts you in charge of a Turkish street food restaurant!<br>Wrap up pre-made \u00e7i\u011fk\u00f6fte, add sauces, drinks, and packaging \u2014 and keep customers happy! \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf73\ud83e\udd64<br><br>\ud83e\uded3 <strong>Wrap &amp; Serve:</strong><br>Place \u00e7i\u011fk\u00f6fte in lava\u015f, drizzle sauces, add garnishes, pack with napkins and drinks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Buy Items Like Bags, Straws, Napkins:</strong><br>Each item helps you perfect your delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddca <strong>Unlock a Drink Fridge:</strong><br>Upgrade your menu with cold beverage options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Customize Your Shop:</strong><br>Change your wall &amp; counter designs, hang your own photo, and earn your business certificate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Unlock Functional Items:</strong><br>Earn money and unlock new systems like the <strong>scale (tart\u0131)</strong> for expanding your workflow \u2014 not for delivery, but for production efficiency!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Pay Daily Rent:</strong><br>Manage your income wisely or risk losing it all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd2b <strong>Mysterious Visitors:</strong><br>Not every customer comes for food \u2014 choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>A vibrant, fast-paced first-person simulator full of Turkish flavor and charm!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New Shop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3698250/327af5659945068441b5a215289bd04e762036b4.jpg"},{"name":"First Earnings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3698250/fc1